            "src": "https://mailcraft.contentor.app/gallery-assets/concrete-plinth-digest/brutalist-facade.jpg",
            "alt": "A wide shot of a contemporary minimalist concrete museum building at dusk. The geometric structure features smooth cast-in-place concrete panels, cantilevered volumes, and large floor-to-ceiling glass windows...",
            "width": 600,
            "link": ""
