        {
          "id": "cpd-6",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>Built to carry two-ton electromechanical switching racks, post-war telecom bunkers have 4.5-meter floor-to-ceiling slabs and column grids that outlast commercial office towers by a century. Three European towns just turned theirs into sunlit reading rooms.</p>",
            "variables": []
          },
